  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your occult benefactors jealously guard your soul, improving your resistance to mind-affecting abilities.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Iron Will, Unyielding Personality†, bind spirit class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> While you are bound to a spirit, whenever you fail a Will save against a mind-affecting effect, you may attempt a second Will save 1 round later at the same saving throw DC. You only receive this one additional chance to save against the mind-affecting effect.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/pact-magic-feats#toc50\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
